  "ruleText": "Per 102.37 “Examination” means a written test or practical performance test designed to assure that an applicant possesses the ability to perform the duties for a particular classification.\n\nSource. #5373, eff 4-27-92; ss by #6729, eff 4-21-98; renumbered by #14132-A; ss by #14434 (formerly Per 102.33), eff 12-1-25",
